{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal Honor - Order of the Apocalypse is a challenging hack \u2018n\u2019 slash roguelite game, featuring eldritch creatures, fast-paced melee combat, and powerful abilities. Become part of a secret organization that investigates the paranormal and fights for the survival of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266060/extras/309351e6e7cd00117ee939551941623d.poster.avif?t=1762934357\" width=612 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266060/extras/309351e6e7cd00117ee939551941623d.webm?t=1762934357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn comic panels are seamlessly integrated into the gameplay to fully immerse you in a dark story full of mystery and intrigue. With every run and every death, you uncover more of the dangers of Wolf Island and the secrets that lie within.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266060/extras/c3d2850059a16e1f30ead21739421a40.avif?t=1762934357\" width=612 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the disturbing secrets of Lethal Honor in a story that happens during your runs through the biomes of the island. Alternate between Lost Agents and Key Agents, who follow their own story, as you discover what is happening on the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266060/extras/190fa7922e875dbfd9ad04f5ce420b31.poster.avif?t=1762934357\" width=612 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266060/extras/190fa7922e875dbfd9ad04f5ce420b31.webm?t=1762934357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacking relentlessly will only lead to your early demise. Find your own style by combining unique abilities, artifacts, and enchantments into powerful combinations. Fight difficult bosses and show your superiority. Unleash hell onto your enemies!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Lethal Honor \u2013 Order of the Apocalypse!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266060/extras/b1cb190cee83a92b71e0369b6fed5056.avif?t=1762934357\" width=612 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal and punishing hack \u2018n\u2019 slash roguelite gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty, hand-drawn, dark age graphic novel art style combined with 3D scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different biomes and playable key characters with their own storyline, abilities, and playstyles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil a mature, dark, and complex story seamlessly integrated into procedurally generated runs </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266060/extras/3fa97e20779bae97fc48ec4846c3fb26.avif?t=1762934357\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Poor David","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/5ac94cdf74471371f6603ed59d8c276094563cab.jpg"},{"name":"Get Away From Me, B****!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/225de00248a349e3b35afa5076c1362e2030e59a.jpg"},{"name":"Pathetic Humans","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/3294f627ab72475c23cd4f078335ae67f76fcc1b.jpg"},{"name":"You're Fired!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/aac9517c5eb3d0ca02bc76141213dc9b5ee8db60.jpg"},{"name":"Daddy Issues","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/f8123580062d8658d5ca27f2b12d3d1a09dcfc7b.jpg"},{"name":"Headless Hivemind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/ce9a47022641308ae6b8f7615b2a140db6e856b6.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/7168cc7bbf19acd7eefae26f85fe920cadd6223f.jpg"},{"name":"Why, You Little...!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/b3a9d0fe8c484db6e54a5aaf9ced2d77227ce4ac.jpg"},{"name":"The Harder The Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/739c99dc98aa615b6b2d2a869c9fd434af9cac42.jpg"},{"name":"Not A Tapeworm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1266060/65604fade0a18297d1e53ff3797cb823c1344f50.jpg"}],"total":42},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1266060?t=1762934357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea